---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="加拿大法语键盘练习 (Canadian - CSA) · 高瑜泽"
  description="针对 macOS Canadian - CSA 键盘布局的痛点键位定制的个人物理打字练习工具，参考 TypingClub 完整虚拟键盘与指法映射。"
  wide
  noindex
>
  <div class="french-practice">
    <header class="practice-header">
      <div class="eyebrow-row">
        <p class="eyebrow">Clavier Canadien - CSA · Entraînement TypeClub</p>
        <div class="header-badges">
          <a href="https://tts.gaoyuze.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge-link" title="打开法语音频工作台">
            🎙️ 法语音频工作台 (1000H) ↗
          </a>
          <span class="badge">macOS 物理键盘映射</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1>加拿大法语键盘物理指法练习</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        像 <strong>TypingClub</strong> 一样对齐真实笔记本物理键盘。重点克服 <code>é è à ç</code> 直出、死键 <code>^ ¨</code> 以及最反人类的 <strong>撇号 <code>'</code></strong>（Shift + ,）与 <strong>问号 <code>?</code></strong>（Shift + 6）。
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- 顶部核心速查卡 -->
    <section class="cheat-card" aria-label="核心键位速查">
      <div class="cheat-header">
        <span class="cheat-title">🎯 核心痛点速查（物理按键 vs CSA 实际输出）</span>
        <div class="cheat-actions">
          <button id="toggle-finger-colors" class="btn-subtle" type="button" aria-pressed="true">🎨 指法分区配色：开</button>
          <button id="toggle-cheat" class="btn-subtle" type="button" aria-expanded="true">收起速查</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="cheat-body" class="cheat-grid">
        <div class="cheat-item danger">
          <div class="cheat-key">Shift + ,</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">‘ 单引号 (撇号)</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">原单引号键变成了 è！打 <code>c'est</code> 必须用 <strong>Shift + ,</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item danger">
          <div class="cheat-key">Shift + 6</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">? 问号</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">原 /? 键变成了 é！打问号必须用 <strong>Shift + 6</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item success">
          <div class="cheat-key">/ 键</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">é / É (Shift)</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">右 Shift 旁的物理 / 键直接出 <strong>é</strong>，加 Shift 出 <strong>É</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item success">
          <div class="cheat-key">' 键</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">è / È (Shift)</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">回车左边的物理 ' 键直接出 <strong>è</strong>，加 Shift 出 <strong>È</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item success">
          <div class="cheat-key">\ 键</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">à / À (Shift)</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">回车上方的物理 \ 键直接出 <strong>à</strong>，加 Shift 出 <strong>À</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item success">
          <div class="cheat-key">] 键</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">ç / Ç (Shift)</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">右中括号键直接出 <strong>ç</strong>，加 Shift 出 <strong>Ç</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item warn">
          <div class="cheat-key">[ 键 (死键)</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">^ 长音符</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">先按 [（屏幕无反应），再按 e/a/i/o/u 得到 <strong>ê â î ô û</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cheat-item warn">
          <div class="cheat-key">Shift + [</div>
          <div class="cheat-char">¨ 分音符</div>
          <div class="cheat-desc">先按 Shift+[，再按 e/i/u 得到 <strong>ë ï ü</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 练习控制台 -->
    <div class="practice-controls">
      <div class="mode-selector" role="tablist" aria-label="训练关卡">
        <button class="mode-tab active" data-mode="accents" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
          <span class="tab-step">01</span>
          <span class="tab-name">四大直出变音 (é è à ç)</span>
        </button>
        <button class="mode-tab" data-mode="punctuation" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
          <span class="tab-step">02</span>
          <span class="tab-name">致命标点与缩写 (' 与 ?)</span>
        </button>
        <button class="mode-tab" data-mode="deadkeys" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
          <span class="tab-step">03</span>
          <span class="tab-name">死键专项 (^ 与 ¨)</span>
        </button>
        <button class="mode-tab" data-mode="vocab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
          <span class="tab-step">04</span>
          <span class="tab-name">高频核心法文词汇</span>
        </button>
        <button class="mode-tab" data-mode="sentences" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
          <span class="tab-step">05</span>
          <span class="tab-name">实用日常金句实战</span>
        </button>
        <button class="mode-tab" data-mode="custom" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
          <span class="tab-step">自由</span>
          <span class="tab-name">自定义输入练习</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="action-bar">
        <button id="btn-restart" class="btn-action" type="button" title="重新开始当前关卡 (快捷键: Esc)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 15-6.7L21 8M21 3v5h-5M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-15 6.7L3 16M3 21v-5h5"/></svg>
          重新开始 (Esc)
        </button>
        <button id="btn-next" class="btn-action" type="button" title="下一批文本">换一组内容</button>
        <div class="stats-group">
          <div class="stat-pill"><span class="stat-label">WPM</span><span id="stat-wpm" class="stat-val">0</span></div>
          <div class="stat-pill"><span class="stat-label">正确率</span><span id="stat-acc" class="stat-val">100%</span></div>
          <div class="stat-pill"><span class="stat-label">进度</span><span id="stat-prog" class="stat-val">0 / 0</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 自定义文本输入抽屉 -->
    <div id="custom-drawer" class="custom-drawer" hidden>
      <div class="custom-drawer-head">
        <label for="custom-text-input">粘贴你想要练习的法语文本：</label>
        <a href="https://tts.gaoyuze.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-inline">
          🎙️ 从法语音频工作台生成句子与听力 ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <textarea id="custom-text-input" rows="3" placeholder="例如：C'est la vie ! Où est la gare ? J'apprends le français..."></textarea>
      <button id="btn-load-custom" class="btn-primary" type="button">加载自定义文本</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 交互提示栏（实时指法与按键说明） -->
    <div class="live-hint-bar" id="live-hint" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="hint-main">
        <span class="hint-icon">💡</span>
        <span class="hint-text" id="hint-text">点击下方文本区域，或直接按键开始打字。</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hint-finger-badge" id="hint-finger-badge">准备开始</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 打字核心展示区 -->
    <div class="typing-box" id="typing-box" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="打字练习文本区">
      <div id="text-display" class="text-display"></div>
      <input id="hidden-input" class="hidden-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>

    <!-- 完整物理键盘 (TypingClub 风格) -->
    <section class="keyboard-section" aria-label="完整物理键盘交互视窗">
      <div class="kb-meta">
        <div class="kb-meta-left">
          <span class="kb-tag">⌨️ 物理 ANSI 键盘布局</span>
          <span class="kb-sub">灰字为键盘原物理字符，主字为 CSA 输出。按 Shift 键时键盘实时联动。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kb-legend">
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-lp"></span>左手小指</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-lr"></span>左手无名</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-lm"></span>左手中指</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-li"></span>左手食指</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-th"></span>大拇指</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-ri"></span>右手食指</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-rm"></span>右手中指</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-rr"></span>右手无名</span>
          <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-dot color-rp"></span>右手小指</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="physical-keyboard show-fingers" id="physical-keyboard">
        <!-- 第 1 行: 数字行 -->
        <div class="k-row">
          <div class="k-key f-lp" data-code="Backquote"><span class="k-phys">~ `</span><span class="k-shift">~</span><span class="k-norm">`</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lp" data-code="Digit1"><span class="k-phys">1 !</span><span class="k-shift">!</span><span class="k-norm">1</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lr" data-code="Digit2"><span class="k-phys">2 @</span><span class="k-shift">@</span><span class="k-norm">2</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lm" data-code="Digit3"><span class="k-phys">3 #</span><span class="k-shift">#</span><span class="k-norm">3</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="Digit4"><span class="k-phys">4 $</span><span class="k-shift">$</span><span class="k-norm">4</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="Digit5"><span class="k-phys">5 %</span><span class="k-shift">%</span><span class="k-norm">5</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri k-alert" data-code="Digit6"><span class="k-phys">6 ^</span><span class="k-shift k-highlight">?</span><span class="k-norm">6</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri" data-code="Digit7"><span class="k-phys">7 &amp;</span><span class="k-shift">&amp;</span><span class="k-norm">7</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rm" data-code="Digit8"><span class="k-phys">8 *</span><span class="k-shift">*</span><span class="k-norm">8</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rr" data-code="Digit9"><span class="k-phys">9 (</span><span class="k-shift">(</span><span class="k-norm">9</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp" data-code="Digit0"><span class="k-phys">0 )</span><span class="k-shift">)</span><span class="k-norm">0</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp" data-code="Minus"><span class="k-phys">- _</span><span class="k-shift">_</span><span class="k-norm">-</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp" data-code="Equal"><span class="k-phys">= +</span><span class="k-shift">+</span><span class="k-norm">=</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-backspace f-rp k-mod" data-code="Backspace"><span class="k-spec">delete ⌫</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 第 2 行: QWERTY 行 -->
        <div class="k-row">
          <div class="k-key k-w-tab f-lp k-mod" data-code="Tab"><span class="k-spec">tab ⇥</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lp" data-code="KeyQ"><span class="k-norm">Q</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lr" data-code="KeyW"><span class="k-norm">W</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lm" data-code="KeyE"><span class="k-norm">E</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="KeyR"><span class="k-norm">R</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="KeyT"><span class="k-norm">T</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri" data-code="KeyY"><span class="k-norm">Y</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri" data-code="KeyU"><span class="k-norm">U</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rm" data-code="KeyI"><span class="k-norm">I</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rr" data-code="KeyO"><span class="k-norm">O</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp" data-code="KeyP"><span class="k-norm">P</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp k-dead" data-code="BracketLeft"><span class="k-phys">[ &#123;</span><span class="k-shift">¨</span><span class="k-norm">^</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp k-accent" data-code="BracketRight"><span class="k-phys">] &#125;</span><span class="k-shift">Ç</span><span class="k-norm">ç</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-backslash f-rp k-accent" data-code="Backslash"><span class="k-phys">\ |</span><span class="k-shift">À</span><span class="k-norm">à</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 第 3 行: 基准行 (Home Row) -->
        <div class="k-row">
          <div class="k-key k-w-caps f-lp k-mod" data-code="CapsLock"><span class="k-spec">caps lock ⇪</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lp" data-code="KeyA"><span class="k-norm">A</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lr" data-code="KeyS"><span class="k-norm">S</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lm" data-code="KeyD"><span class="k-norm">D</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li k-home" data-code="KeyF"><span class="k-norm">F</span><span class="k-bump"></span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="KeyG"><span class="k-norm">G</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri" data-code="KeyH"><span class="k-norm">H</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri k-home" data-code="KeyJ"><span class="k-norm">J</span><span class="k-bump"></span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rm" data-code="KeyK"><span class="k-norm">K</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rr" data-code="KeyL"><span class="k-norm">L</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp" data-code="Semicolon"><span class="k-phys">; :</span><span class="k-shift">:</span><span class="k-norm">;</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp k-accent" data-code="Quote"><span class="k-phys">' "</span><span class="k-shift">È</span><span class="k-norm">è</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-enter f-rp k-mod" data-code="Enter"><span class="k-spec">return ↵</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 第 4 行: Shift 行 -->
        <div class="k-row">
          <div class="k-key k-w-lshift f-lp k-mod" data-code="ShiftLeft"><span class="k-spec">⇧ shift</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lp" data-code="KeyZ"><span class="k-norm">Z</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lr" data-code="KeyX"><span class="k-norm">X</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-lm" data-code="KeyC"><span class="k-norm">C</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="KeyV"><span class="k-norm">V</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-li" data-code="KeyB"><span class="k-norm">B</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri" data-code="KeyN"><span class="k-norm">N</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-ri" data-code="KeyM"><span class="k-norm">M</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rm k-alert" data-code="Comma"><span class="k-phys">, &lt;</span><span class="k-shift k-highlight">'</span><span class="k-norm">,</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rr" data-code="Period"><span class="k-phys">. &gt;</span><span class="k-shift">"</span><span class="k-norm">.</span></div>
          <div class="k-key f-rp k-accent" data-code="Slash"><span class="k-phys">/ ?</span><span class="k-shift">É</span><span class="k-norm">é</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-rshift f-rp k-mod" data-code="ShiftRight"><span class="k-spec">⇧ shift</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 第 5 行: 底栏修饰键与空格 -->
        <div class="k-row">
          <div class="k-key k-w-ctrl f-lp k-mod" data-code="ControlLeft"><span class="k-spec">control</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-opt f-lp k-mod" data-code="AltLeft"><span class="k-spec">⌥ option</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-cmd f-lp k-mod" data-code="MetaLeft"><span class="k-spec">⌘ command</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-space f-th" data-code="Space"><span class="k-norm">space</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-cmd f-rp k-mod" data-code="MetaRight"><span class="k-spec">⌘ command</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-opt f-rp k-mod" data-code="AltRight"><span class="k-spec">⌥ option</span></div>
          <div class="k-key k-w-ctrl f-rp k-mod" data-code="ControlRight"><span class="k-spec">control</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 法语音频工作台联动推荐卡 -->
    <section class="french-studio-card" aria-label="法语音频工作台联动">
      <div class="studio-info">
        <div class="studio-title-row">
          <span class="studio-badge">配套法语学习工具</span>
          <h3>法语音频工作台 · 1000H French</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
          结合大语言模型与微软 Edge 神经网络语音合成。支持自动改写润色、CEFR A1-C2 语法纠错与真人级朗读听力，生成的纯正法语文本可无缝复制到此处进行物理键盘打字强化。
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://tts.gaoyuze.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-studio">
        打开法语音频工作台 (tts.gaoyuze.com) ↗
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- 底部原理与技巧指导 -->
    <footer class="practice-guide">
      <div class="guide-col">
        <h3>💡 为什么觉得难受？</h3>
        <p>
          在美式键盘上，你的右手已经建立了“单引号敲回车左边、问号敲 Shift+/”的牢固条件反射。
          而在加拿大 CSA 上，按单引号键直接给你敲出 <code>è</code>，按问号直接敲出 <code>É</code>！
          因此，<strong>先练 Level 02 的缩写专项（把 <code>'</code> 绑定到 <code>Shift+,</code>，问号绑定到 <code>Shift+6</code>）</strong>，是消除别扭感最快的一步。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-col">
        <h3>⌨️ 死键（Dead Key）的心智模型</h3>
        <p>
          所谓“死键”，就是按下之后屏幕光标不往前走，系统在默默等待你的下一个元音：
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>按 <code>[</code>（长音符死键）+ 按 <code>e</code> ➔ 得到 <code>ê</code></li>
          <li>按 <code>Shift + [</code>（分音符死键）+ 按 <code>i</code> ➔ 得到 <code>ï</code></li>
          <li>按 <code>Option + [</code>（抑音符死键）+ 按 <code>u</code> ➔ 得到 <code>ù</code>（在 <code>où</code> 中使用）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-col">
        <h3>🍎 macOS 贴心技巧</h3>
        <p>
          在 Mac 菜单栏右上角的输入法图标里，点击<strong>“显示键盘查看器”（Show Keyboard Viewer）</strong>，它会在桌面上浮动一个小键盘。
          当你按下 Shift 或 Option 时，可以直观看到键位实时切换，非常适合前期辅助。
        </p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .french-practice {
    padding-block: 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 62rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .practice-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .eyebrow-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .eyebrow-row .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .header-badges {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .badge-link {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }
  .badge-link:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .badge {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    background: var(--soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--strong-line);
    color: var(--muted);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .practice-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }
  .practice-header .lead {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .practice-header code {
